# canvas-app: soma-messages
# Dedicated DEMO pairing. Whole-pane controls must not dismiss the focused thread.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.messages
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.messages/.MainActivity
expect Messages
tap Sideways
doubletap Photo
tap Show replies
expect Replies
keyboard hidden
tap Record a voice message
expect Stop recording
shot thread-recording
wait 2500
tap Stop recording
expect Send voice message
shot thread-voice-review
tap Send voice message
wait 3500
expect Voice message, tap to play
expect Replies
shot thread-voice-sent
closeime
key BACK
expect Photo
key BACK
expect Messages
# Own DEMO SSE observer must record audio/x-caf with replyTo DEMO-SIDEWAYS-1.
